extends baseEmail

block content
  h2(style='font-size: 18px; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 15px;') Password Recovery Request
  p We received a request to reset the access credentials for your Velora Skin account.
  p Select the secure button below to choose a new password.
  .btn-container
    a.btn(href=`${url}`, target='_blank') Reset Password
  p(style='font-size: 13px; color: #78716C;') For your security, this authorization link will strictly expire in 10 minutes.
  p(style='font-size: 13px; color: #78716C;') If you did not make this request, your account remains secure and no further action is required.